<title>POLAND: Polish shares end lower in lighter live trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares end lower in lighter live trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>BIG and Stalexport fell while Budimex, Debica, Rolimpex and Universal were flat in 0.7-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Monday.</p>
<p>The remaining four stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>On Friday continuous trade turnover was at 1.3 million zlotys.</p>
<p>NFI units rose to 158.5 zlotys in 33.8-million- zloty trade.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
